# Link patterns lychee skips (regex). Read by the pre-commit hook and external-link-check.yml.

# Template placeholder: github.com/ORG/REPO links (e.g. CHANGELOG's [Unreleased]) 404.
https://github.com/ORG/REPO

# The advisory form answers a link check with 404 on a private repository.
^https://github\.com/[^/]+/[^/]+/security/advisories/new$
